Casterwill's first son fought alongside his family in the great war against the [[Nullifiers]]. {{source|Knight of the Willblade}}

Using [[Umbra]], the Titan of Dimensions, he and his siblings teleported to the [[Spiral Mark]] where he watched Lord Casterwill seal the Mark using the [[Willblade]]. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}

Some time after the death of Lord Casterwill, on the longest night of the year, he and his siblings fought [[the Betrayer]] at the [[Spiral Mark]], stopping him from using [[Void]] to call back the Nullifiers. {{source|Chasing Void}}
